# colour: turning it off and on, setting one field to each colour word (cut short too, and empty), beep and nobeep,
# the bad words, default, and all with each colour, red among them. Decimus (10) and Quintus (25) are in the
# temple (3001), both with colour turned on (the fixtures have it off). Decimus says something after a change, so
# Quintus shows the default say colours and Decimus his own. The saved file has the settings.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
colour
